cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template, please cite it as below."
title: "Simulation Project Template"
abstract: >-
  A worked simulation study in R, structured as a starting point for new
  projects. Compares ridge regression, lasso, and principal component regression
  under a linear model with correlated covariates, demonstrating modular
  organization, uniform method interfaces, reproducible parallel replication with
  doRNG, saved raw output, and separation of computation from visualization.
type: software
authors:
